+# AW0.2 Next Block
+
+Next authorized work is **Block 2 — Schema creation and reset boundary**.
+
+Required implementation:
+
+1. Schema 1 creators for `catalog.db` and `user.db`.
+2. All frozen constraints, partial indexes, external-content FTS document
+   tables and system metadata.
+3. Detection of legacy experimental profiles without opening them as Schema 1.
+4. One-time AW0.2 reset state machine using:
+   - verified `SnapshotCreator`;
+   - `profile/reset_state.json`;
+   - generation-specific paths;
+   - idempotent postcondition checks from Reset Protocol v1.1.
+5. Integrity and foreign-key verification before activation.
+
+Required exit tests:
+
+- clean Schema 1 creation;
+- complete indexes and constraints;
+- `integrity_check` and `foreign_key_check`;
+- legacy data archived only after a verified snapshot;
+- interruption at every reset state;
+- repeated launch never resets a completed Core Generation 1 profile.
+
+Do not begin repositories, application services or Games UI until the
+corresponding implementation-plan gates are satisfied.
